  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vietnam Health System Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The investment is DFAT support for health system strengthening and equitable access to essential health services and health products in Vietnam. Delivery partners include World Health Organisation (WHO) in Vietnam. The investment is complementary to DFAT regional and global investments in health in Vietnam and follows on from Australia&#x2019;s strong support for Vietnam&apos;s COVID-19 vaccine response.</narrative>
  </description>
